.row.justify-content-center
  .col-lg-8
    %h1.h3.mb-3 Mini-Enni — Cleaning Verification
    %p.text-muted.mb-4
      A slimmed booking platform. Operators photograph cleaning at their venues;
      an AI classifier scores it; the booking's verification status updates.
    - if current_user.operator? || current_user.system_admin?
      = link_to "Open the operator portal", portal_dashboard_path, class: "btn btn-primary"
    - else
      %p.text-muted You are signed in as a customer.
